Version 0.15 2017-04-28
    Issue 6 - Fixed seller compilation sale type from number to readable category, also joined scientific name and common name.
    Issue 4 - Fixed column headings in list post view, scientific name and common name were switched.
    Issue 5 - Added checks that fleamarket posts have a numeric price before seller is able to commit.
    Issue 8 - Added server side printing using CUPS printing system, a default printer should be set. That is done with the commands:
        lpstat -p -d to se list of available printers and the default if set.
        lpoptions -d printer_name to set the default printer.

